    "Läbipaistmatu osa nähtavas valguses (0,4–0,76 µm) vähemalt 150 m, infrapunas (2–5,6 µm) vähemalt 30 m": "Opaque part at least 150 m in visible light (0.4–0.76 µm) and at least 30 m in infrared (2–5.6 µm)",
    "Kuni 11 kg.": "Up to 11 kg.",
    "5 (esimese lüli kabiinis)": "5 (in the front unit cab)",
    "Kahelüliline roomikmaastikusõiduk raskete koormate veoks soos, liivas ja lumes ning äärmuslikus kliimas; liigub vees roomikutega. DT-10PM: mass 23,5t, kandevõime 10t, 710hj, kuni 44km/h. Tootmises alates 1982": "Two-unit articulated tracked carrier for heavy loads in swamp, sand and snow and in extreme climates; propelled by its tracks in water. DT-10PM: 23.5t, payload 10t, 710hp, up to 44km/h. In production since 1982",
    "DT-30 tühimass; kandevõime samuti 30 t.": "DT-30 curb weight; payload also 30 t.",
    "Kuni 20 (esilülis 5 koos juhiga)": "Up to 20 (5 including the driver in the front unit)",
    "YaMZ-5347-26 diisel, Allisoni automaatkäigukast": "YaMZ-5347-26 diesel, Allison automatic transmission",
    "Kahelüliline ujuv roomikmaastikusõiduk Arktika tingimustesse (sarnane Bv 206-ga): esilüli on jõumoodul, tagalüli ümberehitatav sõitjate-, sanitaar-, magamis- või juhtimismoodul; mõlemad lülid köetavad. Kasutustemperatuur −50 kuni +40°C. Kasutusel alates 2019": "Two-unit amphibious articulated tracked vehicle for Arctic conditions (similar to the Bv 206): the front unit is the power module, the rear unit can be configured as a passenger, medical, sleeping or command module; both units are heated. Operating temperature −50 to +40°C. In service since 2019",
    "Esilüli 500–750 kg, tagalüli 2000–2250 kg (allikad erinevad).": "Front unit 500–750 kg, rear unit 2,000–2,250 kg (sources differ).",
    "1 + 2 kabiinis": "1 + 2 in the cab",
