    "Mustangi perekonna suurim (8×8) taktikaline veok; kasutusel ka suurtükiveduki ja eriseadmete šassiina (nt 1B75 Penicilin, Moskva-1)": "Largest (8×8) tactical truck of the Mustang family; also used as an artillery tractor and special equipment chassis (e.g. 1B75 Penicillin, Moskva-1)",
