    "SNAR-10M (1RL232-1): radar asendatud Kredo-1E-ga, 40 km sõidukitele, lisaks digitaalne kuvar ja side. SNAR-10M1 (1RL232-2): laiemalt kasutusel. M1 variant on Venemaa maaväes kasutusel nime all „SANR-10M Pantera“ (tootmises).": "SNAR-10M (1RL232-1): radar replaced with the Kredo-1E, 40 km for vehicles, plus a digital display and communications. SNAR-10M1 (1RL232-2): more widely used. The M1 variant is in Russian Ground Forces service as \"SANR-10M Pantera\" (in production).",
